{"id":"8761123b6893eaa5","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-goodstein-subtract-then-bump.md","title":"本书先减一再升底数的 Goodstein 步","display":"df-goodstein-subtract-then-bump — 本书先减一再升底数的 Goodstein 步","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-goodstein-subtract-then-bump","aliases":["72-df-goodstein-subtract-then-bump"],"display":"df-goodstein-subtract-then-bump — 本书先减一再升底数的 Goodstein 步","depends_on":["[[72-df-hereditary-base-change]]"],"chapter":"III","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.III Definition5.1, print191/PDF203; all b≥2 local extension","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"source step order and total recursive sequence checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"created":"2026-10-22","revision_round":"2026-10-22-expansion"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-goodstein-subtract-then-bump"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-goodstein-subtract-then-bump</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-goodstein-subtract-then-bump — 本书先减一再升底数的 Goodstein 步"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d0e3fa6d930415cd\" href=\"?note=d0e3fa6d930415cd\" title=\"72-df-hereditary-base-change\">72-df-hereditary-base-change</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"III"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.III Definition5.1, print191/PDF203; all b≥2 local extension"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"source step order and total recursive sequence checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-22-expansion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b,a,k\\in\\omega\">\\(b,a,k\\in\\omega\\)</span> 且 b≥2；Bump 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d0e3fa6d930415cd\" href=\"?note=d0e3fa6d930415cd\" title=\"72-df-hereditary-base-change\">72-df-hereditary-base-change</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g_b\">\\(g_b\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_{b,a}\">\\(G_{b,a}\\)</span> 由下式总函数及自然数递归定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"g_b(a):=\\begin{cases}0,&amp;a=0,\\\\\\operatorname{Bump}_{b,b+1}(a-1),&amp;0&lt;a,\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[g_b(a):=\\begin{cases}0,&amp;a=0,\\\\\\operatorname{Bump}_{b,b+1}(a-1),&amp;0&lt;a,\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"G_{b,a}(0):=a,\\qquad G_{b,a}(k+1):=g_{b+k}(G_{b,a}(k)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[G_{b,a}(0):=a,\\qquad G_{b,a}(k+1):=g_{b+k}(G_{b,a}(k)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>严格保留书中的顺序：先把 a−1 作 complete base-b 展开，再升到 b+1。常见的“先升底再减一”是另一种编号变体，数值轨迹与长度不能混用。原书以 x+1 为底数并在讨论中加了范围条件；此处明确扩为全部 b≥2、a∈ω，并用0吸收使递归全定义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-hereditary-base-change","status":"resolved","id":"d0e3fa6d930415cd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-hereditary-base-change]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-hereditary-base-change","status":"resolved","id":"d0e3fa6d930415cd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$b,a,k\\in\\omega$ 且 b≥2；Bump 取 [[72-df-hereditary-base-change]]。$g_b$ 和 $G_{b,a}$ 由下式总函数及自然数递归定义。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"b,a,k\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"g_b","display":false},{"tex":"G_{b,a}","display":false},{"tex":"g_b(a):=\\begin{cases}0,&a=0,\\\\\\operatorname{Bump}_{b,b+1}(a-1),&0<a,\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"G_{b,a}(0):=a,\\qquad G_{b,a}(k+1):=g_{b+k}(G_{b,a}(k)).","display":true}],"bytes":1502,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-113","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"III章新增9项：[[72-df-goodstein-stopping-time]] · [[72-df-goodstein-subtract-then-bump]] · [[72-df-hereditary-base-change]] · [[72-df-hereditary-base-expression]] · [[72-df-hereditary-expression-evaluation]] · [[72-ex-goodstein-small-sequence]] · [[72-lem-goodstein-ordinal-descent]] · [[72-lem-hereditary-base-order]] · [[72-thm-goodstein-termination]]"},{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-487","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"III章新增9项：[[72-df-goodstein-stopping-time]] · [[72-df-goodstein-subtract-then-bump]] · [[72-df-hereditary-base-change]] · [[72-df-hereditary-base-expression]] · [[72-df-hereditary-expression-evaluation]] · [[72-ex-goodstein-small-sequence]] · [[72-lem-goodstein-ordinal-descent]] · [[72-lem-hereditary-base-order]] · [[72-thm-goodstein-termination]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-482","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"III章新增9项：[[72-df-goodstein-stopping-time]] · [[72-df-goodstein-subtract-then-bump]] · [[72-df-hereditary-base-change]] · [[72-df-hereditary-base-expression]] · [[72-df-hereditary-expression-evaluation]] · [[72-ex-goodstein-small-sequence]] · [[72-lem